WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.976
Before you begin, use the five-second check: route clear, load stable, equipment

2
00:00:05.976 --> 00:00:08.964
safe, PPE ready, and people protected.

3
00:00:08.964 --> 00:00:12.475
If one answer is no, stop and fix it or ask for

4
00:00:12.475 --> 00:00:12.768
help.

5
00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:15.800
You are not expected to take an unsafe shortcut.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.793
Thank you for helping every HarbourLink colleague finish the shift safely.

7
00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:23.806
Continue to the hazard activity and the five- question practice quiz.

8
00:00:23.806 --> 00:00:26.241
The practice pass mark is eighty percent.
